{"id": "UgwuJZ119ZVsIen1hUB4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 18, "text": "❤❤❤❤❤아직은살만한세상이네....아가씨같은심성이고운사람들이있어서....😂😢😅🎉🎉🎉🎉🎉", "published": "2026-09-06T20:06:46", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgwOipkhvat6-7oA03h4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 42, "text": "흐뭇하다. 정이넘치네. 복받을거여요", "published": "2026-09-06T20:02:02", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgxPWIIHkeZybBfLQ5B4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 5, "text": "😂😂😂", "published": "2026-09-06T15:03:32", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgyhAeigV6CGYsqCCJ54AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 11, "text": "이런 내용만 내보네세요. 사랑이 넘쳐나네요.", "published": "2026-09-06T13:41:02", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
